sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant API as FastAPI (/chat)
    participant Chat as RAGChatService
    participant QA as QueryAccessService
    participant QE as QueryEnhancer (LLM call 1)
    participant QX as QueryExpander (LLM call 2)
    participant Ret as RetrievalService
    participant Hy as HybridSearchService
    participant Rr as Reranker (CrossEncoder)
    participant Ctx as ContextFormatter
    participant LLM as LLMService (LLM call 3)
    participant HG as HallucinationGuardService (LLM call 4)

    C->>API: POST /chat {question, conversation_id}
    API->>Chat: chat(question, conversation_id, user_id)
    Chat->>QA: is_cross_user_request(question, user_id)
    QA-->>Chat: false (allowed)
    Chat->>QE: enhance(question, history)
    QE-->>Chat: standalone query
    Chat->>QX: expand(enhanced_query)
    QX-->>Chat: 3 query variations (JSON)
    loop for each of 3 queries
        Chat->>Ret: multi_retrieve(...)
        Ret->>Hy: search(query_embedding, query, document_ids)
        Hy-->>Ret: hybrid-ranked chunks
    end
    Ret-->>Chat: merged + deduplicated chunks
    Chat->>Rr: rerank(query, sources)
    Rr-->>Chat: top 3 above reranker_score_threshold
    Chat->>Ctx: format(sources)
    Ctx-->>Chat: labeled context text
    Chat->>LLM: generate(prompt)
    LLM-->>Chat: answer #1
    Chat->>HG: validate(question, context, answer)
    HG-->>Chat: {grounded, confidence, unsupported_claims}
    alt not grounded
        Chat->>LLM: generate(strict_prompt)
        LLM-->>Chat: answer #2 (regenerated)
    end
    Chat-->>API: {answer, sources, search_evaluation}
    API-->>C: 200 OK (or SSE stream via /chat/stream)
